  "pdf_cells": [
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          84.46349376068376,
          118.40274257105943,
          860.0626874358975,
          21.54483785529726
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAS+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Our decentralized structure is an advantage. It gives us flexibility and speed in reacting to local"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          84.46349376068376,
          136.94238372093025,
          860.0070921367521,
          21.544851098191202
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAS+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "conditions. Our division leaders are well-positioned to respond immediately to the needs, changes"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          84.46349376068376,
          155.48203811369513,
          379.95224940170937,
          21.544837855297146
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAS+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "and developments among their customers."
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          479.5147816239316,
          155.48203811369513,
          464.7887555555556,
          21.544837855297146
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAS+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "We in the corporate office set the goals, establish the"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          84.46349376068376,
          174.02167926356594,
          860.0633357264958,
          21.544837855297033
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAS+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "discipline, provide financial resources, management and operational support, but it is in our local"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          84.46349376068376,
          192.5613336563307,
          860.1634352991454,
          21.54483785529726
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAS+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "divisions where customer relationships are established and the work is done. Our community-based"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          84.46349376068376,
          211.10097480620152,
          859.9260207692307,
          21.54483785529726
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAS+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "focus forges strong local relationships and ensures that, at the customer level, the highest expectations"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          84.46349376068376,
          229.6406291989665,
          115.18619897435899,
          21.544837855297033
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAS+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "are exceeded."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          84.46349376068376,
          258.66870865633075,
          859.9424908547008,
          21.54483785529726
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAS+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Ultimately, all the things we do as a Company are aimed at increasing value for our shareholders. We"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          84.46349376068376,
          277.20834980620157,
          859.9722246153847,
          21.544837855297146
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAS+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "know the importance of strong and predictable cash flow in meeting our shareholders’ expectations."
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          84.46349376068376,
          295.74800419896644,
          859.9933904273504,
          21.544837855297146
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAS+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Over time, our cash flow has proven to be a strong indicator of the quality of our earnings. Last year’s"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          84.46349376068376,
          314.28764534883726,
          859.6368481196581,
          21.544837855297033
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAS+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "record free cash flow enabled us to reinvest in our business, acquire new companies, repurchase $266"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          84.46349376068376,
          332.827299741602,
          860.1176694871796,
          21.54483785529726
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAS+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "million of our common stock and double the quarterly dividend to $0.12 per share. The plan this year"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          84.46349376068376,
          351.36694089147284,
          859.8682703418802,
          21.544837855297146
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAS+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "is similar. We will continue to use our strong free cash flow to grow and strengthen the Company by"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          84.46349376068376,
          369.90658204134377,
          859.9035583760684,
          21.54485109819109
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAS+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "building our customer base through internal growth and strategic acquisitions. Additionally, we plan"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          84.46349376068376,
          388.4462364341085,
          860.1223652136753,
          21.544877583979314
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAS+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "to repurchase Republic stock worth up to $275 million and pay a regular quarterly cash dividend to"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          84.46349376068376,
          406.98593055555557,
          631.6702075213676,
          21.544837855297146
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAS+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "our shareholders. We believe these steps will increase shareholder value. "
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          84.46349376068376,
          472.74444799741605,
          858.794157948718,
          21.544837855297146
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAS+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "We are focused on improving our service and strengthening relationships with our customers."
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          84.46349376068376,
          491.28408914728686,
          860.0013100854702,
          21.544837855297146
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAS+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Exceptional service allows us to build loyalty and create lasting bonds with those we serve. We will"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          84.46349376068376,
          509.82374354005174,
          859.8952182051282,
          21.544837855297146
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAS+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "continue to train and develop our people, too, so they may grow as we grow as a Company. And we"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          84.46349376068376,
          528.3634244186046,
          860.0659113675215,
          21.544837855297203
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAS+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "will continue to focus on improving the safety of our operations, an important commitment we have"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          84.46349376068376,
          546.9030788113696,
          391.32365196581196,
          21.544837855297146
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAS+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "made to our people and service communities."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          84.46349376068376,
          575.9310655684754,
          533.6278186324787,
          21.544851098191202
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAS+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "The last year was indeed an outstanding one for Republic."
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          637.186273931624,
          575.9310655684754,
          307.42889829059834,
          21.544851098191202
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAS+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Our goal is to continue to deliver"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          84.46349376068376,
          594.4707596899225,
          225.12615709401712,
          21.544837855297146
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAS+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "impressive results in 2005."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          84.46349376068376,
          623.4987596899225,
          6.564757051282044,
          21.544837855297146
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAS+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "I"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          95.89824658119659,
          623.4987596899225,
          848.5094551282052,
          21.544837855297146
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAS+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "am both privileged and grateful to have the opportunity to lead a team of such exceptional people."
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          84.46349376068376,
          642.0384008397933,
          859.9649532478633,
          21.544837855297146
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAS+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Everyday, I grow more impressed with the experience, knowledge, loyalty and hard work they"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          84.46349376068376,
          660.5780949612404,
          804.8774408547008,
          21.544837855297203
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAS+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "contribute. Republic truly has one of the best management and operations teams in America. "
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          84.46349376068376,
          689.6060817183463,
          859.8836716239317,
          21.544851098191202
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAS+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "On behalf of all of us at Republic, I want to thank our shareholders for the trust they have placed in"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          84.46349376068376,
          708.1457758397933,
          859.2711070940172,
          21.544837855297146
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAS+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "us. We are a Company that cares about you, and we pledge to continue working hard to serve you in"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          84.46349376068376,
          726.6853772609819,
          150.6880464102564,
          21.54489082687337
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAS+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "2005 and beyond."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          84.46349376068376,
          755.7134434754522,
          80.17779354700853,
          21.544851098191202
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAS+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Sincerely,"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          84.46349376068376,
          859.1283817829458,
          167.4348293162393,
          20.729102067183447
        ],
